#: changelog/entries.py
msgid "Gaea's Cradle, Elvish Archdruid, Nykthos and Tron"
msgstr "Gaea's Cradle, Elvish Archdruid, Nykthos und Tron"

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid ""
"Mana that counts your board now makes what it counts: Gaea's Cradle and "
"Circle of Dreams Druid one green for each creature, Elvish Archdruid and "
"Priest of Titania one for each Elf, Cabal Stronghold one black for each "
"basic Swamp, Crypt of Agadeem one for each black creature card in your "
"graveyard, Nykthos your devotion, and the Urza lands seven together."
msgstr ""
"Mana, das dein Spielfeld zählt, macht jetzt so viel, wie es zählt: Gaea's "
"Cradle und Circle of Dreams Druid ein Grün pro Kreatur, Elvish Archdruid und"
" Priest of Titania eins pro Elf, Cabal Stronghold ein Schwarz pro basic "
"Swamp, Crypt of Agadeem eins pro schwarze Kreaturenkarte in deinem Friedhof,"
" Nykthos deine Ergebenheit, und die Urza-Länder zusammen sieben."

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
#, python-format
